<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>套壳设置</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>预先配置套壳素材</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>先选择素材，或从相册选图并定位屏幕四角，也可从文件导入 PNG＋配置。选中已导入素材可点「定位素材四角」重新校准并另存。调整外观后点击「保存配置」。以后触发「套壳截图」即自动套壳并直接输出，无需进入编辑器。随机素材在每次截图时选择一次。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>素材与外观</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>configureFrame</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>输出遵循截图页的「默认结果动作」和「保存同时复制」。可通过截图页的套壳截图、系统动作或快捷指令 prefs://root=metis_frame 触发。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
